            sizeEx = 0.021;
            colorText[] = {0.78, 0.82, 0.90, 1};
            colorBackground[] = {0.02, 0.03, 0.06, 0.55};
            text = "Select the occupied range slot the drill runs on.\n\nMin / Max: random distance band (meters) from the pit for the drill point. The server picks dry land at least 500 m from the main base (FADE_basePos), up to 25 samples; widen the band or use random bearing if start fails.\n\nThe server spawns a locked civilian vehicle there, plus a vanilla burning metal barrel (smoke/flame) offset from the car.\n\nOptional: set FADE_firesDrillFireClass in Config for an extra marker object (e.g. campfire); leave empty for barrel only.\n\nBearing: along pit axis or random approach.\n\nDrill completes when the car takes damage (near impact) or is destroyed. End drill cancels and removes spawned props.";
        };
